        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9111be60-2647-44f9-900e-d59f548b4da5).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rWe&apos;ve managed to track another 4 infected, but this time they are located in Argentina. Mendoza, to be exact.  I&apos;m sure you already know where you&apos;re going, no?\r\rIntel says that, they are close friends with eachother, and got an opportunity to visit this beautiful land. However, 2 of them decided to stay in Argentina, and work at the retirement party hosted by none other than Don Yates. The other 2, are guests at the party.\r\rOur clients suggests a fast &quot;cleanup&quot;.\r\rGood luck.",
